      "content": "The sense of emotional numbness and feeling disconnected from others' experiences suggests a profound feeling of isolation. This emptiness, especially after dedicating yourself to a cause, can be deeply painful. It might be helpful to gently explore what needs you weren't able to fulfill while immersed in that cause. A therapist can provide a safe space to process these complex feelings of disconnection and identity.",
      "source": "target",
